OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOvercast
OL,6,Fwith rain spreading across the region
OL,7,Fduring the evening from the northwest.
OL,8,FThe rain, heavy at times, will turn
OL,9,Flighter and patchier, away from the
OL,10,FPennines towards dawn. Winds
OL,11,Fstrengthen and become blustery in
OL,12,Fplaces. Temperatures around average.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FMostly cloudy to start with
OL,15,Fpatchy light rain, turning partly
OL,16,Fcloudy and drier but with some showers
OL,17,Fdeveloping in places. Blustery winds
OL,18,Fwith temperatures just above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
