OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWindy
OL,6,FSaturday, with sunny spells and
OL,7,Fshowers. Dry, with a mix of cloudy
OL,8,Fperiods and sunny spells on Sunday,
OL,9,Fwind easing. Becoming cloudy with rain
OL,10,FMonday afternoon, breezy at times.
